:{\"en\":\"Meaning and Measures of Kurtosis\",\"hi\":\"कुर्टोसिस का अर्थ एवं माप\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Meaning of Skewness\",\"hi\":\"विषमता का अर्थ\"}},\"difficulty\":\"advanced\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified: SSC CGL Statistics — Measures of Skewness\",\"source_metadata\":null,\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"SSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0}],\"nextCursor\":\"8332de0a-03b9-43db-9712-e583d5938758\",\"hasMore\":true}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":300,"tags":["question-batch","question-batch:subtopic:v9:544dd518-c5d2-48cc-8def-0e9a0b3bcddf"]}